  "description": "The Classic Microsoft Dynamics CRM tool, now in the XrmToolBox suite.\n\n\t\t\tThis is special flavor of classical Plugin Registration Tool provided by Microsoft as CRM SDK code sample. It was adopted to the format of an XrmToolBox tool and intended to work with the same set of the Common Data Service / Dynamics 365 / CRM versions as supported by main application.",
